# Force LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites LF to CRLF on
# checkout. A CRLF shebang makes bash fail with "bad interpreter: No such file
# or directory" — so without this, bin/* is broken on Windows before it runs.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
